# builds your plugin with keel's own build (scripts/build-plugin-repo.sh). To build against a newer keel, put a newer
# commit on the last line, for example the newest of plugin-base:
#   git ls-remote https://github.com/MiladNalbandi/keel-v2 refs/heads/plugin-base
# Lines that start with # are comments.
